  "templateJson": {
    "children": [
      {
        "dataId": 3862357,
        "name": "Section1",
        "text": "Introduction",
        "label": "",
        "type": "question",
        "children": [
          {
            "dataId": 3862358,
            "name": "Label1",
            "text": "Welcome to the TCU IRB interactive online submission system: Cayuse Human Ethics. <strong>Please review for new information!<br><br><a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cayuse-2.0-Summary-of-Changes_8.2024.docx\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Cayuse-2.0-Summary-of-Changes_8.2024.docx\">Cayuse 2.0 Summary of Changes</a></strong><br> <br> Required sections are listed on the left. <strong>As you answer questions, new sections relevant to the type of research being conducted may appear or disappear based on your responses.</strong><br> <br> Once each section is completed, a checkmark will appear beside the section name on the left. All questions marked with a red asterisk must be answered for a section to be marked complete.<br> <br> If you have trouble seeing all the sections, you may need to adjust your screen resolution to be able to see them. Until all sections are complete, the last item listed on the left will be Submit.<br> <br> As you progress, be sure to click<strong> SAVE (upper right) regularly</strong>. Please note that a submission may take several hours to complete. You do not have to finish in one sitting or complete sections in any specific order.<br> <br> Information can be found on the <a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/\">Human Subject Research</a> page on the <a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance\">Research Compliance</a> website. Office of Research Compliance (ORC) staff are also available to answer questions by emailing IRBSubmit@tcu.edu. If you have questions regarding Quality Assurance, please email&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:QAprogram@tcu.edu\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:QAprogram@tcu.edu\">QAprogram@tcu.edu</a>.<br><br><strong>Please take time to review our website. New information and updates are available for your reference and guidance.<br></strong><br>HSR Homepage - <a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/\">https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/</a><br><br>All things Cayuse - <a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/cayuse-human-ethic/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/cayuse-human-ethic/\">https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/c...</a><br><br>IRB submission & review process - <a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/irb-submission-process/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/irb-submission-process/\">https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/i...</a><br><br>Education & Outreach - <a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/education-outreach/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/education-outreach/\">https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/e...</a><br><br>IRB Guidance Documents - <a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/irb-guidance-documents/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/irb-guidance-documents/\">https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/i...<br><br></a>Quality Assurance Program&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/quality-assurance-program/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/quality-assurance-program/\">https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/q...</a><br><br>Research Documentation and Record Support:<br>Study Start-Up Tool-Kit-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/quality-assurance-program/study-start-up-tool-kit/\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/quality-assurance-program/study-start-up-tool-kit/\" target=\"_blank\">https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/q...</a><br><br>Self-Audit Tool-Kit-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/quality-assurance-program/self-audit-tool-kit/\" title=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/quality-assurance-program/self-audit-tool-kit/\" target=\"_blank\">https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/q...</a><br><br>Clinical Trial Resources-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/quality-assurance-program/clinical-trial-resources/\" target=\"_blank\">https://research.tcu.edu/research-compliance/irb/q...</a><br><br> <strong>Review the information below and confirm before beginning.</strong><br> <br><ul><li>As all study investigators should be familiar with the framework of human research protections and how they relate to the proposed study, all study investigators should have completed the appropriate online CITI human subjects research training prior to submitting. </li>  <li>Submissions are reviewed according to the date received and submission type. The time it takes to receive feedback depends on the completeness of the submission,      the complexity of the research, and the volume of studies already under review at the time the submission is received.</li>  <li>Allowing ample time for review and responding promptly to feedback is recommended,      as final approval/exempt determination is dependent on an investigator's timely and sufficient responses to any comments the IRB may have.</li>  <li>Research activities/data collection may not begin until a formal IRB approval or exempt determination letter has been received.</li></ul>",
            "required": false,
            "helpText": "",
            "label": "",
            "type": "label"
          },
          {
            "dataId": 3862359,
            "name": "Group15",
            "text": "I have reviewed the information and am ready to begin my submission.",
            "description": "",
            "required": true,
            "helpText": "",
            "compoundType": "radio",
            "label": "",
            "type": "question",
