          {
            "dataId": 3862551,
            "name": "TextArea87",
            "text": "<strong>Background</strong>",
            "description": "<div>Describe the theory or data supporting the study's objectives and include a bibliography of key references as applicable.<br></div><ul><li><em>Briefly discuss relevant background information and literature reviewed to provide the rationale for the proposed research.</em></li><li><em>Cite references in text, as appropriate, to justify the purpose and hypothesis[es].</em></li><li><em>State the relevance of this research to and potential for contribution to the field of research.</em></li></ul>",
            "required": false,
            "helpText": "<ul><li>This item lets you expand on the summary. Again, it should be brief ~ a few paragraphs.</li><li>If you copy and paste from your proposal, be sure to accept destination formatting and edit as necessary. <strong>In particular, change any past tense verbs to future tense.<br></strong></li><li><strong>Note the request to cite references in the text and to upload the bibliography as a separate document. The IRB does not need to receive the full bibliography that supports the proposal.</strong></li></ul>",
            "label": "",
            "type": "textarea",
            "dependencies": [
              {
                "targetId": 3862484,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862502,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862511,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862532,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862514,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862517,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862509,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862500,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862518,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862526,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862527,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862528,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862529,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862530,
                "type": "displayed"
              }
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "dataId": 3862552,
                "name": "AttachButton35",
                "text": "<strong>Attach a bibliography of the references cited in the background section.</strong>",
                "required": false,
                "helpText": "",
                "label": "",
                "type": "attachment"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dataId": 3862553,
            "name": "TextArea88",
            "text": "<strong>Participant Population & Recruitment</strong>",
            "description": "<div><em><strong>Please ensure to respond to every&nbsp; question applicable</strong></em><em><strong>&nbsp;to your research:</strong></em></div><ol><li>Identify and describe&nbsp;the subject population (Adults, students, children, MTurk workers, etc.) targeted for the research (including&nbsp;total enrollment number and any group/cohort breakdown numbers). <em>For example: 50; 25 children; 25 parents</em></li><li>If not recruiting actual subjects (e.g., database query for eligible tissue samples, secondary analysis of existing data), state what will be queried and how and by whom eligible samples/data will be identified.</li><li>Specify how subjects will be selected, i.e., the inclusion and exclusion criteria. (Inclusion/exclusion criteria should be as specific as possible and include definitive parameters, as your role in this process is crucial to the study's success.)<br>(The study must include the proposed subject population's age range, a decision that carries significant weight and should be carefully considered (e.g., 18 years and older; 18-65 years; 7 years and older; 7-17 years; etc.).)</li><li>If the study&nbsp;excludes a particular population (such as males, females, or non-English speakers), it is crucial to provide a scientific justification for the exclusion, underscoring the importance of this step.</li><li>If including any vulnerable populations (children (as applicable), pregnant women, diminished capacity, non-readers, etc.), state why their inclusion is essential and any specific benefits and additional protections.</li><li>Please indicate if there will be any screening procedures (no screening, self-screen via recruitment material, or describe how the study plans to screen potential participants and explain how the study will document eligibility). If screening will occur, please upload the consent script for&nbsp;<a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screening-Treatment-Consent-Script_Template_6.2024.docx\" target=\"_blank\">treatment</a> or&nbsp;<a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screening-Non-Treatment-Consent-Script_Template_6.2024.docx\" target=\"_blank\">non-treatment</a>.</li><li>Describe <strong>in detail all methods</strong> for recruitment and enrollment.</li><li>If this is a SONA study, please state so and upload the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://research.tcu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Sona-Advertisement-Form-Approved-by-IRB-board-4.3.2020-2.docx\" target=\"_blank\">SONA advertisement</a> form in the attachment point below.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li></ol>",
            "required": false,
            "helpText": "",
            "label": "",
            "type": "textarea",
            "dependencies": [
              {
                "targetId": 3862484,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
