            "children": [
              {
                "dataId": 3862583,
                "name": "Radio71",
                "text": "Yes",
                "required": false,
                "helpText": "",
                "label": "",
                "type": "radio",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "dataId": 3862584,
                    "name": "TextArea52",
                    "text": "<ol><li>Describe where the data or specimens will be stored and how long they will be stored.</li><li>How will the data or specimens be labeled?</li><li>Who will have access to the data or specimens?</li><li>Will data or specimens be shared with other investigators?</li></ol>",
