              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dataId": 3862875,
            "name": "TextArea90",
            "text": "<strong>Study Design/ Methodology</strong>",
            "description": "<ol><li>Specify if the study is a retrospective, prospective (or both)&nbsp;chart review the study team will conduct (e.g., case series, case-control study, cohort study). Explain the rationale for choosing the desired design.</li><li>Describe the procedure for obtaining data. Specify the source of the medical records(e.g., specific hospital, electronic health record system).</li><li>Elaborate on the meticulous data collection process, including the timeframe for chart selection(e.g., past five years); Data abstraction procedures (how data will be extracted from the charts), to instill a sense of thoroughness in the research.</li><li>List all specific variables (data points) the study plans to collect from charts. Define each variable operationally (how it will be measured or categorized). Indicate if the data is already coded in the charts or needs manual abstraction. </li><li>Describe the plan for data storage and security (e.g., de-identification procedures, password protection).</li><li>Specify the software or statistical methods you will use for data analysis.</li><li>Explain how the study will ensure patient confidentiality and privacy throughout the study (Compliance with HIPAA).</li><em><strong>Every question must be addressed, or the application will be returned for changes.&nbsp;</strong></em></ol>",
            "required": false,
            "helpText": "",
            "label": "",
            "type": "textarea",
            "dependencies": [
              {
                "targetId": 3862777,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862778,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862779,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
                "targetId": 3862655,
                "type": "displayed"
              }
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "dataId": 3862876,
                "name": "AttachButton38",
                "text": "Attach a data collection form (MS EXCEL) and list all elements or identifiers to be collected as a part of the study.<br>",
                "required": false,
                "helpText": "",
                "label": "",
                "type": "attachment"
              },
              {
                "dataId": 3862877,
                "name": "AttachButton39",
                "text": "You may attach the flowchart here.<br>",
                "required": false,
                "helpText": "",
                "label": "",
                "type": "attachment"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dataId": 3862878,
            "name": "AttachButton11",
            "text": "Please upload <strong>ALL</strong> instruments, measures, scales, interview guides, and questionnaires/surveys that will be used in this research",
            "required": true,
            "helpText": "",
            "label": "",
            "type": "attachment",
            "dependencies": [
              {
                "targetId": 3862762,
                "type": "displayed"
              },
              {
